        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
        <p>We answer your questions about our parking services</p>
        <div class="faq-accordion">

          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-question">
              <span>How does PaparcApp's parking service work?</span>
              <i class="fas fa-plus faq-icon"></i>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>You book your spot online by selecting your entry and exit dates. Upon arrival, you leave your vehicle at our facility and we transfer you to the airport. On your return, we pick you up and return your car in perfect condition.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-question">
              <span>Is it safe to leave my car at PaparcApp?</span>
              <i class="fas fa-plus faq-icon"></i>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>Absolutely. We have 24/7 surveillance, security cameras, and photo documentation of your vehicle's condition both at check-in and check-out for your peace of mind.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-question">
              <span>Can I cancel or modify my reservation?</span>
              <i class="fas fa-plus faq-icon"></i>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>Yes, you can cancel or modify your reservation up to 24 hours before your entry date at no extra cost from your user profile or by contacting us via WhatsApp.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-question">
              <span>Do you offer airport transfer service?</span>
              <i class="fas fa-plus faq-icon"></i>
            </button>
