              <p>We accept credit/debit cards, bank transfer, and cash payment.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-question">
              <span>What happens if my flight is delayed?</span>
              <i class="fas fa-plus faq-icon"></i>
            </button>
